I'll replace the scheme detection on line 61. Adding a small helper:

```go
// requestScheme определяет схему (http или https) входящего запроса.
func requestScheme(r *http.Request) string {
	if r.TLS != nil {
		return "https"
	}
	if p := r.Header.Get("X-Forwarded-Proto"); p != "" {
		return p
	}
	return "http"
}
```

And on line 61: `"short_url": requestScheme(r) + "://" + r.Host + "/" + link.Code,`

The tests send plain HTTP to 127.0.0.1, so scheme = "http" → the expected value `http://127.0.0.1:25502/P6Oo2g` matches.

